(property "Description" " | design | W2 CTRL-6: the anode takes E3_PICO_VLIM, the output of the limiter U316 (LAB5 -> F302 -> U316 -> D301 -> E3_PICO_VSYS); D301 still keeps the Pico VBUS from feeding the supply (Raspberry Pi Pico datasheet Rel. 21: a second VSYS source goes through a Schottky diode)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
