(property "Reference" "F302" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) ))
(property "Value" "MF-MSMF050-2 0.5A" (at 0 -2.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) ))
(property "Footprint" "Fuse:Fuse_1812_4532Metric" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Datasheet" "https://www.bourns.com/docs/Product-Datasheets/mf-msmf.pdf" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Description" " | design | W2 CTRL-6 (recipe of build/15 \"Захист VSYS Pico за D301\", reviews RV4-E-3/RV4-S-1): PTC ahead of the Pico VSYS limiter U316, so that the IN/EN copper of U316 and an IN-GND bridge of its SOT-23-6 (pin 1 IN next to pin 2 GND) are limited by the PTC and never by F102 4 A alone; on CTRL its LAB5 pad 1 sits on the 1.85 mm LAB5 feed, so no LAB5 copper narrower than the class width reaches a SOT-23-6 pin. Bourns MF-MSMF050: Vmax 15 V, Imax 100 A, Ihold 0.50 A / Itrip 1.00 A at 23 C, Ihold 0.77 A at -40 C, 0.68 A at -20 C, 0.33 A at 70 C, Rmin 0.15 ohm, R1max 1.0 ohm, 8.0 A trips in 0.15 s max, tripped dissipation 0.8 W typ (REV. BE 09/26, read 2026-11-22). The smallest family member whose 70 C Ihold (0.33 A) holds the U316 maximum limit IOSmax 0.209 A: a VSYS short is handled by U316 alone, the PTC trips only on a fault ahead of U316.; Reflow soldering only, as F301 (Bourns MF-MSMF REV. BE solder reflow recommendations, read 2026-11-22)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
