(property "Description" " | design | RILIM of U316: 150k +-1 % gives IOS 0.154-0.209 A (SLVS841G eq. 1, IOSmax = 22980/R^0.94 at 148.5k; eq. 3, IOSmin = 25230/R^1.016 at 151.5k; recommended 15-232k): above the about 0.145 A Pico VSYS estimate of build/15 and below the 0.224 A of the 0.15 mm inner E3_PICO_VSYS copper (MODEL). Bench gate: Pico VSYS current (OPEN)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
