(text "IMU assembly and two metre single-ended UART need bench verification. Internal named-pad wiring is specified,\nbut no physical harness has been measured.\nВорота (стенд): Check actual module revision, GX16 plug/socket viewing direction and continuity to E5 design\npinout; validate input Schottky and TVS at both ends; 1e6 frames with zero CRC errors. Upgrade to differential\ninterface if errors occur." (at 13.97 303.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1981c69c-0ad1-541a-8d56-cba31b394fc8))
